<title>NETHERLANDS: Amsterdam Exchanges B share price NLG 1,400-1,800.</title>
<headline>Amsterdam Exchanges B share price NLG 1,400-1,800.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>ABN AMRO said on Monday the price of the privately placed &quot;B&quot; shares of the Amsterdam Exchanges will be between 1,400 and 1,800 guilders.</p>
<p>The 50,000 seven percent cumulative preference shares each have a nominal value of 1,000 guilders, said ABN AMRO which is bookrunner and global coordinator.</p>
<p>The shares will go to former exchange association members and to institutional investors.</p>
<p>Subscriptions began on Monday, closing on Friday. The pricing and allocation of shares will take place next Monday.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
